  "body": "### What is the issue with the HTML Standard?\r\n\r\nThe [getContextAttributes](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/canvas.html#dom-context-2d-canvas-getcontextattributes) method allows for querying properties of a [`CanvasRenderingContext2D`](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/canvas.html#2dcontext), such as its color space, alpha state, etc.\r\n\r\nThis method is not present on [`OffscreenCanvasRenderingContext`](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/canvas.html#offscreencanvasrenderingcontext2d).\r\n\r\nThis doesn't seem right, especially considering that the offscreen canvas 2D context [is created](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/canvas.html#offscreen-2d-context-creation-algorithm) using [`CanvasRenderingContext2DSettings`](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/canvas.html#canvasrenderingcontext2dsettings). Is that just an oversight?",
